ves both concealed pungs (W3x3, B3x3)\n- Maintains flexibility with W1-W2-W4 tiles\n\nReason: F2 is an isolated honor tile that doesn't contribute to my current hand structure of two concealed pungs (W3x3 and B3x3). While F2 is my Seat Wind and could score points if completed as a pung, keeping it reduces my hand's efficiency. Discarding F2 allows me to focus on a pung-based strategy with my strong concealed pungs while maintaining some flexibility with the W1-W2-W4 sequence.\n\nAnswer: Play F2"}
